(text "PLACEMENT PROTOTYPE - NOT FOR MANUFACTURE OR FULL-CURRENT TEST" (at 20 153 0) (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2298376f-9192-53ec-bf04-df8c8f952e9c))
(text "1. One cell is one-sixth of the future 220 A RMS module: about 51.9 A peak with ideal sinusoidal sharing." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0ee9e8ef-d9ba-57d6-ab45-3ae47e22208c))
(text "2. QH1 / QL1 symbol exposes every package pad: 1 gate; 2,4,6 source; 3,5,7 drain. No separate Kelvin package pin." (at 20 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid db645d3c-f050-59ae-9a81-a738cee638bc))
(text "3. Gate return must take off at the source pad nearest the gate; copper geometry defines Kelvin performance." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 28249a19-0ffe-5d91-af98-3ae3cf92ac06))
(text "4. Cold plate contacts the source-connected FET tops through insulating TIM. Driver circuitry is external." (at 20 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid bd537c84-3147-5c39-942a-7f58446718bb))
(text "5. Port pads and driver pads are interface placeholders, not selected/rated connectors. RG values require driver tuning." (at 20 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid f9458805-db65-55ef-9f91-1bee4012343f))
(text "6. Verify VDS overshoot, capacitance bias/ripple, current sharing, coolant conditions and completed routing before release." (at 20 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid d0637778-7f58-5f7b-84a4-e4893ea21cb4))
